# Clone can't copy a creature that enters the battlefield at the same time as it does (the card's ruling, CR 614.1c,
# 707.2): what it may copy is what is already there as it enters. Bot1's Clone is cast on turn 1 and declined, dying as
# a 0/0; Bot2 discards a Guerrilla Gorilla to hand size on turn 2. On turn 3 Exhume puts Clone and the Gorilla onto the
# battlefield together: Clone is offered Bot1's two Ornithopters and not the Gorilla (refused beside the Ornithopter it
# takes), and enters as an Ornithopter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Clone
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Exhume
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Guerrilla Gorilla x20

